d runs 75 years from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 7 grids March to April, April to May and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 42 of those years. In 2025 the middle of the grids got 36% of normal in September to October and 36% in October to November. Grids 9429 and 9729 had their driest year in 2011, at 42% of normal.</p>"}
